      "cooked": "<p>Time for some DE rules question and more next week for items in RCR</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-65-0\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-65-0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-65-0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #65</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Good morning, everybody! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:27:28 We do some goofs at the beginning, as per usual! You know how it goes! Let's talk about the upcoming schedule!  Tuesday, April 4th: Episode #244 - Writers’ Room: A Silver Gulch Story Tuesday,...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming Schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, April 4th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#244</span> - Writers’ Room: A Silver Gulch Story</li>\n<li>Tuesday, April 11th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#245</span> - Writers’ Room: A Hero turned Villain</li>\n<li>Tuesday, April 18th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#66</span>\n</li>\n<li>Tuesday, April 25th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#246</span> - Writers’ Room: Alien Artifact on Insula Primalis (which is the Citizen Dawn event from the core game)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Expected Recording Schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Friday, March 31st: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#244</span> - Writers’ Room: A Silver Gulch Story</li>\n<li>Friday, April 7th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#245</span> - Writers’ Room: A Hero turned Villain</li>\n<li>Friday, April 14th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#66</span>\n</li>\n<li>Friday, April 21st: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#246</span> - Writers’ Room: Alien Artifact on Insula Primalis (which is the Citizen Dawn event from the core game)</li>\n</ul>",
